5mm\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eExplore the MiP Pro 1.5mm LED display for professional-grade visuals in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers top LED display technology. Inquire today!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMiP technology. 35% less power. Zero compromise.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eMini-in-Package technology delivers SMD-level serviceability with COB-level contrast. Common cathode flip-chip architecture saves 35% energy. 7,680Hz refresh eliminates moire in broadcast environments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of the MiP Pro 1.5mm and why does it matter?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe MiP Pro features a 1.5mm pixel pitch, which ensures ultra-high resolution and crisp image quality, ideal for close viewing distances in corporate and retail environments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does MiP technology benefit power consumption compared to traditional SMD displays?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eMiP technology in the MiP Pro reduces power consumption by 35% compared to standard SMD panels without compromising brightness or color quality, enabling cost savings and greener operation.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eIs the MiP Pro suitable for broadcast applications requiring high refresh rates?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, with a 7,680Hz refresh rate, the MiP Pro eliminates moiré and flicker, making it ideal for broadcast environments where smooth rendering is critical.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat kind of servicing options does the MiP Pro 1.5mm offer?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe MiP Pro features front-access serviceability, allowing easy maintenance and module replacement without rear access, which is ideal for tight installations.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",