chema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"MiP Pro 1.5mm\", \"description\": \"Mini-in-Package technology delivers SMD-level serviceability with COB-level contrast. Common cathode flip-chip architecture saves 35% energy. 7,680Hz refresh eliminates moire in broadcast environments.\", \"sku\": \"BL-MIP150\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-mip150\", \"category\": \"mip\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-mip150.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 1800, \"highPrice\": 12000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-mip150\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1,200 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"400 x 225 per panel\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Taf6,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the MiP Pro 1.5mm and why does it matter?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The MiP Pro features a 1.5mm pixel pitch, which ensures ultra-high resolution and crisp image quality, ideal for close viewing distances in corporate and retail environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does MiP technology benefit power consumption compared to traditional SMD displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"MiP technology in the MiP Pro reduces power consumption by 35% compared to standard SMD panels without compromising brightness or color quality, enabling cost savings and greener operation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the MiP Pro suitable for broadcast applications requiring high refresh rates?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, with a 7,680Hz refresh rate, the MiP Pro eliminates moir\\u00e9 and flicker, making it ideal for broadcast environments where smooth rendering is critical.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of servicing options does the MiP Pro 1.5mm offer?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The MiP Pro features front-access serviceability, allowing easy maintenance and module replacement without rear access, which is ideal for tight installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the MiP Pro compare to COB LED displays in contrast and serviceability?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The MiP Pro combines SMD-level serviceability with COB-level contrast (10,000:1), delivering superior image depth while allowing easy front maintenance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support are available with the MiP Pro 1.5mm displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers standard manufacturer warranty terms on the MiP Pro along with dedicated regional support in the GCC/Middle East to ensure reliable operation and service.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the MiP Pro be customized for different installation environments like retail or corporate offices?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the MiP Pro\\u2019s small pixel pitch and modular design allow versatile installations tailored to spaces such as corporate lobbies, retail walls, and broadcast studios.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical pricing context of the MiP Pro 1.5mm compared to other fine pixel pitch LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The MiP Pro offers a competitive balance of premium image quality and energy efficiency, often providing cost savings over traditional SMD and COB hybrids, especially when factoring in power and maintenance savings.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"MiP Pro 1.5mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-mip150\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T5dc,<h1>MiP Pro 1.5mm</h1><p>Explore the MiP Pro 1.5mm LED display for professional-grade visuals in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers top LED display technology. Inquire today!</p><p><strong>MiP technology. 35% less power. Zero compromise.</strong></p><p>Mini-in-Package technology delivers SMD-level serviceability with COB-level contrast. Common cathode flip-chip architecture saves 35% energy. 7,680Hz refresh eliminates moire in broadcast environments.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the MiP Pro 1.5mm and why does it matter?</h3><p>The MiP Pro features a 1.5mm pixel pitch, which ensures ultra-high resolution and crisp image quality, ideal for close viewing distances in corporate and retail environments.</p><h3>How does MiP technology benefit power consumption compared to traditional SMD displays?</h3><p>MiP technology in the MiP Pro reduces power consumption by 35% compared to standard SMD panels without compromising brightness or color quality, enabling cost savings and greener operation.</p><h3>Is the MiP Pro suitable for broadcast applications requiring high refresh rates?</h3><p>Yes, with a 7,680Hz refresh rate, the MiP Pro eliminates moiré and flicker, making it ideal for broadcast environments where smooth rendering is critical.</p><h3>What kind of servicing options does the MiP Pro 1.5mm offer?</h3><p>The MiP Pro features front-access serviceability, allowing easy maintenance and module replacement without rear access, which is ideal for tight installations.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"MiP Pro 1.5mm LED Display | Brightluxx Dubai UAE\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Explore the MiP Pro 1.5mm LED display for professional-grade visuals in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers top LED display technology. Inquire today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-mip150\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0