anels without compromising brightness or color quality, enabling cost savings and greener operation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the MiP Pro suitable for broadcast applications requiring high refresh rates?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, with a 7,680Hz refresh rate, the MiP Pro eliminates moir\\u00e9 and flicker, making it ideal for broadcast environments where smooth rendering is critical.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of servicing options does the MiP Pro 1.5mm offer?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The MiP Pro features front-access serviceability, allowing easy maintenance and module replacement without rear access, which is ideal for tight installations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the MiP Pro compare to COB LED displays in contrast and serviceability?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The MiP Pro combines SMD-level serviceability with COB-level contrast (10,000:1), delivering superior image depth while allowing easy front maintenance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support are available with the MiP Pro 1.5mm displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers standard manufacturer warranty terms on the MiP Pro along with dedicated regional support in the GCC/Middle East to ensure reliable operation and service.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the MiP Pro be customized for different installation environments like retail or corporate offices?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the MiP Pro\\u2019s small pixel pitch and modular design allow versatile installations tailored to spaces such as corporate lobbies, retail walls, and broadcast studios.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical pricing context of the MiP Pro 1.5mm compared to other fine pixel pitch LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswe